//PRODUKTE.http
### Login-Test
POST https://localhost:3002/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login-Test
POST https://localhost:3002/logout

### Variables
@id=7
### Produkte GET
GET https://localhost:3002/produkte

### Produkte POST
POST https://localhost:3002/produkte
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "preis": 2,
  "kategorie": "Snack"
}

### Produkte ID GET
GET https://localhost:3002/produkte/{{id}}

### Produkte ID PUT
PUT https://localhost:3002/produkte/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test 2",
  "preis": 2,
  "kategorie": "Snack",
  "aktiv": "true"
}

### Produkte ID DELETE (deaktivate)
DELETE https://localhost:3002/produkte/{{id}}

### Produkte TYPE GET
GET https://localhost:3002/produkte/type/Drink

